# Force LF line endings for files that get executed as scripts, regardless
# of the local git core.autocrlf setting -- CRLF corruption on Windows
# checkouts silently breaks bash's shebang/blank-line parsing (hit for real
# during this project's Mission Agent integration testing: a plain
# `git merge --ff-only` reintroduced CRLF into simulation/network/*.sh even
# though the committed blobs were already correct LF).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
